#. Tag: title
#: introduction.docbook:2
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Introducción"

#. Tag: para
#: introduction.docbook:5
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This user manual is intended to describe the contents and use of the "
"&sflphone-client-kde; &sflphonerelease; softphone. &sflphone-client-kde; is a "
"&kde; client for &sflphone;. It communicates with the core side, sflphone "
"daemon, through &DBus;. &sflphone; is meant to be a robust enterprise-class "
"desktop phone. It provides functions like call transfer, call hold, multiple "
"lines, multiple accounts support. It is SIP and IAX2 compatible. &sflphone; "
"audio layer is built upon a native ALSA interface and a native PulseAudio "
"interface."
msgstr ""

